 "grammar": {
  "title": {
   "ko": "전화 표현 (Can I speak to …?)",
   "en": "Phone phrases (Can I speak to …?)"
  },
  "explain": {
   "ko": "전화에서는 Hello로 받고, Can I speak to ...?로 통화를 요청합니다. 상대가 없으면 He isn't here now.라고 하고 Can you leave a message?로 메시지를 부탁해요. I'll call back later.는 '나중에 다시 걸게요'라는 뜻입니다.",
   "en": "Answer with Hello and ask for someone with Can I speak to ...? If he isn't there say He isn't here now and ask Can you leave a message? I'll call back later means I will phone again."
  },
  "table": {
   "head": [
    "표현 / Pattern",
    "예 / Example"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "통화 요청",
     "Can I speak to Mr Lee?"
    ],
    [
     "기다리기",
     "Please hold on."
    ],
    [
     "메시지",
     "Can you leave a message?"
    ],
    [
     "다시 걸기",
     "I'll call back later."
    ]
   ]
  },
  "notes": [
   {
    "ko": "전화번호는 숫자를 하나씩 읽습니다.",
    "en": "Read a phone number digit by digit."
   },
   {
    "ko": "0은 zero 또는 oh라고 읽어요.",
    "en": "0 is read zero or oh."
   },
   {
    "ko": "문자는 send a text, 전화는 make a call이라고 해요.",
    "en": "Say send a text and make a call."
   }
  ],
